BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Morals and Melodies: Aesop’s Fables in Concert! — Providence
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261113T190000
DTSTAMP:20261114T063117Z
UID:c4e15ff946b373daedbf37f36b85@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Performances\, Concerts and Exhibitions\,Provid
 ence\,United States
DESCRIPTION:What happens when timeless tales meet original music? From cle
 ver foxes to unlikely heroes\, Aesop’s fables have captivated audiences 
 for centuries with their memorable characters and timeless morals. Student
  composers and performers are bring these stories to life through original
  musical works\, exploring the characters\, conflicts\, and lessons that m
 ake each fable unique. Each piece offers a different musical interpretatio
 n\, transforming familiar tales into new and unexpected listening experien
 ces. Come experience an evening where storytelling meets sound\, imaginati
 on meets composition\, and timeless morals find new melodies.\nCategory: P
 erformances\, Concerts and Exhibitions\nOriginal listing: https://events.b
 rown.edu/general/event/342345-morals-and-melodies-aesops-fables-in-concert
LOCATION:Grant Recital Hall\, Grant Recital Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.brown.edu/general/event/342345-morals-and-melodies-aeso
 ps-fables-in-concert
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:brown-arts
END:VEVENT
