DESCRIPTION:Staged reading Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 7 PM Churchill Ho
 use\, 155 Angell Street\, PVD RI FREE Registration required Detroit. July
 \, 1967. Connie\, Vera\, and Lorraine – three members of the aspiring gi
 rl band\, the Pink Flamingos – have their hearts set on a night of big f
 un – music\, dancing\, and more. But when the illegal\, afterhours joint
  where they’re partying gets raided by Detroit police\, they are suddenl
 y thrust into the epicenter of the largest urban rebellion in U.S. history
 . Will they make it out alive? And to do so\, will they have to burn their
  dreams\, their friendships\, or their much beloved city\, all down?\nCate
