CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Arts & Culture\,Washington\, DC\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Attend a film festival\, enjoy a special dinner and support GW
  student filmmakers! "Not Another Home Movie" is a University Writing cour
 se culminating in a final project: a short film created by each student. A
 t the end of every semester\, Hanan Daqqa\, lecturer in writing and the fo
 under of the Not Another Home Movie Film Festival\, celebrates the top tru
 e and meaningful stories in her classes in a big public screening. The eve
 nt includes dinner and a keynote speaker. This year it is even bigger and 
 better because of Dean Betsy Shimberg and her amazing team on the Mount Ve
 rnon Campus. The annual film festival is becoming a tradition. The dining 
 team is making it even more delicious with a menu \nCategory: Arts & Cultu
 re\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/fall-2026-top-not-ano
 ther-home-movie-film-memoirs-gw-students
